# PUBG Shorts — Template KS1A (Kills + Assists)

Use when the user asks for **KS1A**, "with assists", or kill shots **plus assist kills**.

Follow global GPU/thermal hard rules.

## Include (on top of KS1)
- Moments where **I knocked** an enemy
- Moments where **I killed / finished** an enemy
- Moments where I got an **ASSIST** (damage that helps a teammate finish)

## Exclude
- Same as KS1 (no Chicken Dinner, no spectator, no other players' unrelated feed)
- Bare map "ASSISTED" counter alone without a fight banner

## Title (HARD)
- **Never** use event/kill/assist **count as the title** (forbid `N Kills Assists Today | PUBG`, `N PLAYS`, folder names driven by detect totals).
- **Always** write an AI title: short punchy hook from the fight vibe (weapons, multi-kill, clutch, assist chain, map feel) then `| PUBG`.
- Examples of shape: `Squad Wipe Assist Chain | PUBG`, `Kar98 Knock Then Finish | PUBG` — not a number dump.
- Output folder / `.mp4` / `.txt` / `.meta.json` names follow that AI title (`sanitize` only). Counts stay inside description/meta only.

## Thumbnail (HARD)
- **Required path** for KS1A Shorts + YT thumbs — do **not** ship the old count card (`make_augniik_thumb.py` giant number + “KILLS + ASSISTS” on raw gameplay still).
- **AI base**: Cursor `GenerateImage` with refs `augniik-character.png` + `augniik-cover.jpg` (character = hero; no logos/badges in the AI prompt).
- **Aspect**: Shorts `9:16` · YT `16:9` — generate each; never stretch 16:9 into 9:16.
- **Composite exactly one logo**: `augniik-profile.jpg` (AUGNIIK mark). No second lobby-avatar circle on top of AI hero (no double avatar).
- `augniik-character.png` = face/outfit **reference** for the AI image only, not a second badge.
- Fallback `scripts/make_augniik_thumb.py` only if `GenerateImage` fails — and still **no** giant kill-count as the hero text; prefer hook words from the AI title.

## Tags
- Moment type: kill + assist montage
- Hashtags can add `#Assist` / `#TeamPlay`; still omit `#ChickenDinner` unless win confirmed
